			"notes": "Every container is now either **built** or **generated** — nothing is left unknown.\n\n## New\n\n- Generated containers are found by structure, dungeon spawner, loot table and the blocks around them\n- Opened dungeon chests stay generated\n- Structures reaching in from the next region file are recognised\n- Containers you place are recorded on vanilla servers too\n- Crafters you place are recorded\n- Chest minecarts in mineshafts count as generated\n- Results tag generated containers\n- Storage chests inside structures count as built: storage-sized stacks, a filled shulker, or a hopper or comparator next to them\n- Shulker boxes in loaders hide with the machines; fed shulkers you can still open stay storage\n- `/chestindex stats` shows how many were placed by elimination\n- Stored indexes have a re-check button next to delete - in singleplayer, and for operators on servers running ChestIndex\n- `/chestindex recheck` reads every indexed chunk again without a full rescan\n\n## Changed\n\n- World scans read chunks several times faster, on up to four threads\n- Picking *Most* re-sorts the list right away\n- The *built* filter no longer mixes in undecided containers\n- Indexes from 1.3 upgrade on first launch, re-reading only the chunks that need it"
		},
