			"notes": "Adds Minecraft `26.3`.\n\n## New\n\n- Filter by amount — `>200`, `<100`, `=421`\n- Container filter moved from `>` to `/` — `/barrel`\n- `/chestindex scan` reads every loaded chunk, not a capped radius\n- Operators are told when a world scan finishes\n- Shorter `/chestindex stats` readout\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Item counts inflating around hoppers\n- Affected worlds re-index themselves on first launch\n- Marker crash on 26.3\n- Trails now follow your render distance\n- Menu no longer passes clicks to the search field\n- Settings survive a crash mid-save\n\n## Changed\n\n- Jars named `chestindex-<version>-<mc>.jar`"
		},
